cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Korin in research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "Korin: lossless GEDCOM for PHP"
abstract: >-
  A PHP library that reads, validates, converts and writes GEDCOM 5.5, 5.5.1, 5.5.5 and 7.0
  without losing a tag, and reports every loss a conversion cannot avoid.
